    "region": "No study was found that validates a unique cortical target for the dense 10–5 site TPP10. On the bundled fsaverage/MNI scalp template, it lies closest to the published 10–10 projection anchors P10 (13.8 mm; inferior posterior scalp near the right skull base; no pertinent Brodmann-area assignment in the atlas), TP8 (39.7 mm; right middle temporal gyrus, BA 21). Its best visualization-oriented description is therefore right inferior scalp/skull-base edge without a reliable unique superficial cortical assignment.",
